              "x": "And here's why it became my daily habit: your hands and eyes are free. I read on that treadmill. I answer messages. I doom scroll. I watch entire movies. The time you already burn on your phone every day can burn fat at the same time. You're not finding time to exercise. You're relocating time you already spend."
