              "x": "Use this tool honestly: it's a correction for the occasional slip, not a daily punishment ritual. If you're walking off overages every other day, the problem is your deficit is too aggressive. Go back to Chapter 2 and pick a calmer speed. The plan should be livable on your worst week."
